&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pine is on a mission to revolutionize home financing in Canada. As LinkedIn’s Top Startups in 2025, we’re building a faster, simpler, and more transparent mortgage experience for Canadians. By combining cutting-edge technology with a human-first approach, we&#39;re making the path to homeownership smarter and hassle-free.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pine is backed by leading venture capital firms and powered by a passionate, collaborative team with a shared love for transforming industries that have been slow to innovate - like mortgage lending.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a BizOps Analyst, you will play a pivotal role in supporting our operations team while gaining invaluable hands-on FinTech experience. Working closely with our passionate teams, you will have the opportunity to contribute to the success of various projects and initiatives, all while developing essential skills for your future career. This position is designed to provide you with a comprehensive understanding of business operations in a fast paced and ever changing FinTech Start Up world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Term&lt;/strong&gt;: 4 - 8 months, beginning January 04, 2027.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a 4 to 8 month internship designed for co-op students, non-co-op students, and recent graduates who are ready to join our rocketship!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Aid in team oversight, team building, problem-solving, and plan implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Assistance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Drive sales efforts by overseeing deals, conducting research, and implementing strategies to support business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-Day Operations:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Data entry, file management, scheduling, customer service, order processing &amp;amp; website maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Support in budget tracking and management, including monitoring expenses and reconciling invoices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contribute to developing and implementing business processes and systems to streamline workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate on projects, allocate resources, and ensure milestones are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research and Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Conduct data entry, data collection, research and analysis to support decision-making and company growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work with cross-functional teams to ensure cohesive efforts and successful project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because of your...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and effective communication abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multitask and prioritize tasks in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible and adaptable to changing priorities and environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong computer skills, and proficiency in Microsoft Office &amp;amp; Google Drive applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company. That&#39;s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any accommodations, please inform Human Resources upon initial connection.&lt;/p&gt;
